/K [25]
>>
endobj
2532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 383 0 R
/E (if `kubectl` is available and configured against a cluster, applies them and waits for the StatefulSet to become ready. If no cluster is available it stops after generating the manifests and prints the commands to run)
/Pg 57 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
